{"title":"Large Coral Snake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 12 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .6 | venomDamage: 16 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>37</td><td>4</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 5.6 · 1,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-large?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"coral-snake-large\" data-map-level=\"11\">Show level 11 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"coral-snake-large\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Snake: <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-small\">Small Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium\">Coral Snake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-small\">Small Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/copperhead-large\">Large Copperhead</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/edf8fd22a5aad68c7401.webp\" alt=\"Large Coral Snake\"></div><h3>Large Coral Snake</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>11</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 12)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Snake</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>corrode · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>34</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>550</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.9 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>17 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}